{"sourceUrl":"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1421673.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:44.819569+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1421673.htm","html":"<div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，政治思想品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>国内高校全日制在校三年级本科生（即</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>届毕业生）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>有望取得就读学校推荐免试研究生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>成绩优秀，英文听说读写能力良好，全国大学英语六级考试成绩不低于</span></span><span><span>426</span></span><span><span>分（或</span></span><span><span>CET-4≥500</span></span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>雅思</span></span><span><span>≥6.0/</span></span><span><span>托福</span></span><span><span>≥90</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span> <span><span><span>科研：有竞赛、大创、论文、专利、科研经历优先。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>中山大学电子与通信工程学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年智能信息处理科学营申请表；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩单</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（须由教务部门盖章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>本科前五个学期同年级专业总成绩排名证明</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（须由教务部门盖章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>学生证及身份证复印件各</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（学生证须将封面及个人信息页正反面复印在</span></span><span><span>A4</span></span><span><span>纸同一面上，身份证须将正反面复印在</span></span><span><span>A4</span></span><span><span>纸同一面上）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>英语水平证明复印件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>份（包括国家四、六级考试成绩，</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span>成绩，</span></span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span><span><span>成绩等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>个人简历一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7.</span></span><span><span>其它证明材料，如代表性学术论文（最多</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>项）、竞赛获奖证书（最多</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>项）、专利证书（最多</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>项）等材料复印件（其中已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页，未发表论文提供单页摘要）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请流程</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名时间</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>即日起至</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日。填写</span></span><span><span><span>https://wj.qq.com/s2/27045499/7050/</span></span></span><span><span>报名问卷，将全部申请材料按顺序扫描整理为同一个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件（文件名为</span></span><span><span>“2026</span></span><span><span>科学营</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>本科就读学校</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>），并上传报名附件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>电子与通信工程学院招收硕士（直博）研究生的相关专业有：</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>招生专业</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>研究方向</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"8\">\n<p><span><span>081000</span></span><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>智能信号处理与目标识别</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>先进成像与信息处理</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>智能光电感知</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>电磁空间安全</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>空间信息获取与智能处理</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>北斗综合智能导航</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>未来无线通信</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>智能通信与信号处理</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\">\n<p><span><span>085400</span></span><span><span>电子信息</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>01</span></span><span><span>新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>02</span></span><span><span>通信工程（含宽带网络、移动通信等）</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>03</span></span><span><span>集成电路工程</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>人工智能</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>140100</span></span><span><span>集成电路科学与工程</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>69</span></span><span><span>不分方向</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>提交纸质材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院网站公布科学营入选名单后，取得入营资格的同学请在报到时将全部申请材料纸质版（第</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>需提供原件）提交至报到处。申请人须对所提交材料的真实性负责，经审核若发现存在材料虚假或材料不合格者，将取消入营资格。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>四、材料审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>科学营资格审核后，将于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日前在中山大学电子与通信工程学院网站（</span></span><span><span>https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/index.htm</span></span><span><span>）上公布入营名单，未入营者不再另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>入营同学请按照日程安排要求报到。如因特殊情况不能参加本次科学营，请于入营名单公布后三天内告知我院。科学营活动期间，所有营员须遵守我院相关规定，报到后应全程参加科学营各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、活动初步安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>时间：</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-11</span></span><span><span>日。若有变化将另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>本次科学营采取线下形式，举办地点：中山大学深圳校区（广东省深圳市光明区新湖街道公常路</span></span><span><span>66</span></span><span><span>号中山大学深圳校区）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群：群号（中大电通</span></span><span><span>2026科学</span></span><span><span>营，<strong><span>951351967</span></strong>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：蓝老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>0755-23260175</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地址：广东省深圳市光明区公常路</span></span><span><span>66</span></span><span><span>号中山大学深圳校区工学园</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>栋</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>北</span></span><span><span>503</span></span><span><span>室（邮编：</span></span><span><span>518107</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>中山大学电子与通信工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<br/>\n<p> 相关附件:<br/>\n\n1、<a href=\"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/docs/2026-06/20260616133611088867.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"中山大学电子与通信工程学院2027届优秀大学生智能信息处理科学营申请表.doc\">2027届优秀大学生智能信息处理科学营申请表</a><br/>\n</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"20084857550bd55140285c1ee42fe51b4501cb41aab1db373a3288c9fad09664","textLength":1374,"sourceSha256":"b7a6a1d320519c0a6beb4419231f5ddf3ad172f4b3babfd1b90b1b7a157e82ea","selector":".cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-09591b0175b76cc167e5","title":"2026年中山大学电子与通信工程学院2026年全国优秀大学生智能信息处理科学营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:44.819569+00:00"}
